    "skillDescriptionsByRefine": {
      "1": {
        "en": "When EX Special Attack hits an enemy, one of three possible effects is randomly triggered for 5 seconds. This effect can trigger once every 0.3s. The same types of effects cannot stack. Repeated triggers reset the duration, allowing several effects to be active at once:\nIncreases the equipper's ATK by 8%, increases the equipper's Anomaly Proficiency by 40, or increases the equipper's Anomaly Buildup Rate by 25%.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]命中敌人时，随机触发以下三种效果中的一种，持续5秒，0.3秒内最多触发一次，同类效果不可叠加，重复触发时刷新持续时间，多个效果可以同时存在：装备者的攻击力提升8%；装备者的异常精通提升40点；装备者的属性异常积蓄效率提升25%。"
      },
      "2": {
        "en": "When EX Special Attack hits an enemy, one of three possible effects is randomly triggered for 5 seconds. This effect can trigger once every 0.3s. The same types of effects cannot stack. Repeated triggers reset the duration, allowing several effects to be active at once:\nIncreases the equipper's ATK by 9.2%, increases the equipper's Anomaly Proficiency by 46, or increases the equipper's Anomaly Buildup Rate by 28%.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]命中敌人时，随机触发以下三种效果中的一种，持续5秒，0.3秒内最多触发一次，同类效果不可叠加，重复触发时刷新持续时间，多个效果可以同时存在：装备者的攻击力提升9.2%；装备者的异常精通提升46点；装备者的属性异常积蓄效率提升28%。"
      },
      "3": {
        "en": "When EX Special Attack hits an enemy, one of three possible effects is randomly triggered for 5 seconds. This effect can trigger once every 0.3s. The same types of effects cannot stack. Repeated triggers reset the duration, allowing several effects to be active at once:\nIncreases the equipper's ATK by 10.4%, increases the equipper's Anomaly Proficiency by 52, or increases the equipper's Anomaly Buildup Rate by 32%.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]命中敌人时，随机触发以下三种效果中的一种，持续5秒，0.3秒内最多触发一次，同类效果不可叠加，重复触发时刷新持续时间，多个效果可以同时存在：装备者的攻击力提升10.4%；装备者的异常精通提升52点；装备者的属性异常积蓄效率提升32%。"
      },
      "4": {
        "en": "When EX Special Attack hits an enemy, one of three possible effects is randomly triggered for 5 seconds. This effect can trigger once every 0.3s. The same types of effects cannot stack. Repeated triggers reset the duration, allowing several effects to be active at once:\nIncreases the equipper's ATK by 11.6%, increases the equipper's Anomaly Proficiency by 58, or increases the equipper's Anomaly Buildup Rate by 36%.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]命中敌人时，随机触发以下三种效果中的一种，持续5秒，0.3秒内最多触发一次，同类效果不可叠加，重复触发时刷新持续时间，多个效果可以同时存在：装备者的攻击力提升11.6%；装备者的异常精通提升58点；装备者的属性异常积蓄效率提升36%。"
      },
      "5": {
        "en": "When EX Special Attack hits an enemy, one of three possible effects is randomly triggered for 5 seconds. This effect can trigger once every 0.3s. The same types of effects cannot stack. Repeated triggers reset the duration, allowing several effects to be active at once:\nIncreases the equipper's ATK by 12.8%, increases the equipper's Anomaly Proficiency by 64, or increases the equipper's Anomaly Buildup Rate by 40%.",
        "zh-CN": "[强化特殊技]命中敌人时，随机触发以下三种效果中的一种，持续5秒，0.3秒内最多触发一次，同类效果不可叠加，重复触发时刷新持续时间，多个效果可以同时存在：装备者的攻击力提升12.8%；装备者的异常精通提升64点；装备者的属性异常积蓄效率提升40%。"
